> Score += BC; at 10000 or more, Score -= 10000 and ScoreHigh += 1 (wrapping from 99 to 0). Outputs none; A, BC, HL destroyed. Callers: PieceTaken $8389 (1200), $A1CB, $A1FE, $A224, the boss beaten $A28E (1400), $A347, $AB19.
