$9B06 Grid3 ; Grid 3 (the second door's tomb, entered in its room 3; EnterGrid3 $8C20): 47 x 9 blocks, 4 rooms, start window at block column 33, map offset 984
$9B0F Grid4 ; Grid 4 (the third door's tomb, entered in its room 2; EnterGrid4 $8C53): 58 x 9 blocks, 5 rooms, start window at block column 22, map offset 1407
$9B18 Grid5 ; Grid 5 (the fourth door's tomb; EnterGrid5 $8C82): 58 x 9 blocks, 5 rooms, map offset 1929
$9B21 Grid8 ; Grid 8 (the boss's hall: the boss in room 2, the crumbling ledges, the urns, the bridge; the stage's exit in room 1; EnterGrid8 $8CB1): 36 x 9 blocks, 3 rooms, map offset 2451
