> CheckWalkBarriers $8175 (Z ends the pass: a barrier throws him back). UP at frame 5 or $0A jumps (WalkJumpCheck). At frames 5 and $0B a wall ahead (FrontCell) stops him (state 0, base column = his column - 1, + 1 facing left); at those frames no direction key stops him too. RIGHT while facing left, or LEFT while facing right, turns him (HeroTurn). The frame goes 0 to $0B; at 0 and 6 the base column moves 2 (MoveBaseX); then HeroWalkShow. As in stage 1 at `$AF64`.
