@module hero
$B3AE c HeroDeath ; Start the hero's death: a burst of eight fragments, the hero hidden, the pause
> Called from `$7F32` and `$7F3C` (LoseLife). Only when no death is in progress (RespawnShiftX = $FF). E = the pause in pairs of passes, stored in the hero's +$10 ($74F0). Clears the missile slots 8-15 ($7610-$763F), adds eight missiles of kind 7 at the hero (column, line + 4) with +4 = 0, 2, .. 14 (the directions) and +5 = the column x 2 (AddMissileHigh), sets state $0F ($74EA), takes the respawn point (RespawnPoint $9477: D column, E line), RespawnShiftX and RespawnShiftY from it, and hides the hero (column 0, line $8C, colour 0). As in stage 1 at `$B22B`.
> Witness: L1 4 (s4-right).
$B3C9 HeroDeathBurst
@module enemies
$B412 c HeadShots ; The boss of grid 8 room 2 spits a shot every 4 passes while BossPhase is 1
> Called every pass by the main loop `$7861`. Only in grid 8, room 2, on passes with PassCounter AND 3 = 0, and BossPhase 1: AddMissile with C = 3 (HeadShot), D = $19, E = $3A (the head's mouth), B = HeadShotDirections[(PassCounter / 4) AND 7], A = 1, then PlaySoundVector 6.
> Witness: L1 8619 (rzx-r4, s4-right).
$B44C b HeadShotDirections 8 ; The direction (0-4) of each shot of the head in turn: 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 3, 2, 1
> Read by HeadShots (LD HL,HeadShotDirections + the shot's number). Read in rzx-r4 (110 shots of the boss's head); not in s4-right.
@module actors
$B454 c AddMissile ; Add a missile (shot, spark) to the first eight slots of the missile records $75E0
> In: D column, E line, C type, B and A its parameters. 16 records of 6 bytes: +0 column ($FF free), +1 line, +2 type (MissileHandlers), +3 $FF, +4 B, +5 A. The search starts after MissileCursor's slot (round robin over 8). A = $FA puts a Random $90AC byte in +5. Out: Z when the eight slots are full (nothing added), else NZ. From HeroThrowMissile `$AEC6` and HeadShots `$B443`. As in stage 1 at `$B28D`.
> Witness: L1 120 (rzx-r4).
$B45C c AddMissileHigh ; Add a missile to the slots 8-15 ($7610) of the missile records
> As in stage 1 at `$B296`.
> Witness: L1 97 (rzx-r4, s4-right).
$B462 c AddMissileFrom ; Add a missile to the eight slots from BC
> As in stage 1 at `$B29C`.
> Witness: L1 217 (rzx-r4, s4-right).
$B464 AddMissileSearch
$B49F AddMissileFull
